{
  "schemaVersion": "1.0.0",
  "contentVersion": "2026.11.10.2",
  "hexagramId": 36,
  "name": "地火明夷",
  "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
  "trustScope": "source-commentary-only;not-authoritative-rules-or-proven-outcomes",
  "attributions": "作者名为原稿所署，未核验独立出版版本；新补文字不署作这些作者原话",
  "groups": [
    {
      "key": "intro",
      "label": "卦义",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "卦辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-05170",
              "text": "明夷：利艰贞。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05170",
                "bodyParagraph": 5106
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-05171",
              "text": "【白话】《明夷卦》象征光明受阻：在这种情况下，最好是在艰难困苦中坚守正道，保持自身的纯洁和善始善终的恒心。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05171",
                "bodyParagraph": 5107
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-05172",
              "text": "《象》曰：明入地中，“明夷”；君子以莅众，用晦而明。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05172",
                "bodyParagraph": 5108
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-05173",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说：《明夷卦》的卦象是离（火）下坤（地）上，离为火，代表光明，为光明入地下之表象，象征着“光明被阻”。君子要能够遵循这个道理去管理民众，即有意不表露自己的才能和智慧，反而能在不知不觉中使民众得到治理。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05173",
                "bodyParagraph": 5109
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "卦义与哲学解读",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-05175",
              "text": "明夷卦坤上离下，地在上、火与日象在下，“明入地中”，象征光明受伤、才智难以显露。卦辞“利艰贞”强调身处艰险时保持正道。此卦在晋卦之后，晋主进升，明夷主前进后可能受伤。君子应外柔内明、韬光养晦；不是放弃原则，而是避免在昏暗局面中徒然暴露自身。事业上可暂时低调，审时而动，保护自身而不随波逐流。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05175",
                "bodyParagraph": 5111
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-1",
      "position": 1,
      "label": "初九",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-05178",
              "text": "初九，明夷于飞，垂其翼；君子于行，三日不食。有攸往，主人有言。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05178",
                "bodyParagraph": 5114
              },
              "patchIds": [
                "detail-edit-0074"
              ],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-05179",
              "text": "【白话】初九，在光明被阻的时候，要像鸟儿一样地迅速飞走，而且要低垂着翅膀以免被人察觉。君子若要退避隐藏，就是丢掉职位、没有饭吃也不在乎。但君子若在此时行动，必然要受到当政者的责备。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05179",
                "bodyParagraph": 5115
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-05180",
              "text": "《象》曰：“君子于行”，义不食也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05180",
                "bodyParagraph": 5116
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-05181",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说：“君子隐藏退避”是由于坚持道义和原则而不愿再拿这份俸禄了。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05181",
                "bodyParagraph": 5117
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "邵雍解（网页吉凶提要）",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-05183",
              "text": "平。该吉凶提示沿用用户所贴传统占解，仅供作为古代文献的一种理解。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05183",
                "bodyParagraph": 5119
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-05185",
              "text": "初九爻动，变为第15卦《谦卦》（地山谦）。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05185",
                "bodyParagraph": 5121
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻义与哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-05187",
              "text": "初九的“垂其翼”借飞鸟低垂翅膀说明光明受抑。君子即使远行三日不食，仍要坚持原则；处境不明时低调离险，不宜强争。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05187",
                "bodyParagraph": 5123
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-2",
      "position": 2,
      "label": "六二",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-05190",
              "text": "六二，明夷，夷于左股，用拯马壮，吉。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05190",
                "bodyParagraph": 5126
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-05191",
              "text": "【白话】《明夷卦》的第二爻位（六二），处在这种光明被阻的情况下，就像伤了左大腿一样，如果能借用好马，增加自己的力量，将会是有利的。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05191",
                "bodyParagraph": 5127
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-05192",
              "text": "《象》曰：“六二之吉”，顺而则也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05192",
                "bodyParagraph": 5128
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-05193",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说：“六二爻之所以能够获得吉祥，是因为它柔顺而又坚持原则。”",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05193",
                "bodyParagraph": 5129
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "邵雍解（网页吉凶提要）",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-05195",
              "text": "吉。该吉凶提示沿用用户所贴传统占解，仅供作为古代文献的一种理解。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05195",
                "bodyParagraph": 5131
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-05197",
              "text": "六二爻动，变为第11卦《泰卦》（地天泰）。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05197",
                "bodyParagraph": 5133
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻义与哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-05199",
              "text": "六二“夷于左股”明示有所损伤，但“用拯马壮，吉”表示能借强有力的帮助脱险。守中有则，柔顺而不失原则，转危为安。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05199",
                "bodyParagraph": 5135
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-3",
      "position": 3,
      "label": "九三",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-05202",
              "text": "九三，明夷于南狩，得其大首；不可疾，贞。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05202",
                "bodyParagraph": 5138
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-05203",
              "text": "【白话】九三，君主在光明受阻的情况下，到南方去巡狩，将可以消灭罪恶的首领。但是应该注意不要操之过急，要能够坚守正道，持之以恒。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05203",
                "bodyParagraph": 5139
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-05204",
              "text": "《象》曰：“南狩之志”，乃大得也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05204",
                "bodyParagraph": 5140
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-05205",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说：有到南方征伐巡狩的志向，就会有非常大的收获。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05205",
                "bodyParagraph": 5141
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "邵雍解（网页吉凶提要）",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-05207",
              "text": "平。该吉凶提示沿用用户所贴传统占解，仅供作为古代文献的一种理解。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05207",
                "bodyParagraph": 5143
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-05209",
              "text": "九三爻动，变为第24卦《复卦》（地雷复）。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05209",
                "bodyParagraph": 5145
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻义与哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-05211",
              "text": "九三“明夷于南狩，得其大首”指出在艰困中行动仍可能获得重大成果，但“不可疾，贞”戒操之过急。南方之象与下卦离相联系。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05211",
                "bodyParagraph": 5147
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-4",
      "position": 4,
      "label": "六四",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-05214",
              "text": "六四，入于左腹，获明夷之心，于出门庭。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05214",
                "bodyParagraph": 5150
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-05215",
              "text": "【白话】六四，进入左方腹部，能够深入了解光明被阻的内中情况，于是坚定地跨出门庭，离开这里。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05215",
                "bodyParagraph": 5151
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-05216",
              "text": "《象》曰：“入于左腹”，获心意也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05216",
                "bodyParagraph": 5152
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-05217",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说：“进入左方腹部”，因此能够从内部深刻了解光明受阻的情形。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05217",
                "bodyParagraph": 5153
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "邵雍解（网页吉凶提要）",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-05219",
              "text": "平。该吉凶提示沿用用户所贴传统占解，仅供作为古代文献的一种理解。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05219",
                "bodyParagraph": 5155
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-05221",
              "text": "六四爻动，变为第55卦《丰卦》（雷火丰）。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05221",
                "bodyParagraph": 5157
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻义与哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-05223",
              "text": "六四“入于左腹，获明夷之心，出于门庭”描写深入了解昏暗局势的根源之后，选择离开是非之地。既明其内情，离开才是明智之举。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05223",
                "bodyParagraph": 5159
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-5",
      "position": 5,
      "label": "六五",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-05226",
              "text": "六五，箕子之明夷，利贞。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05226",
                "bodyParagraph": 5162
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-05227",
              "text": "【白话】六五，应采取箕子那种自掩其聪明才智的做法，这样做有利于坚守正道。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05227",
                "bodyParagraph": 5163
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-05228",
              "text": "《象》曰：“箕子之贞”，明不可息也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05228",
                "bodyParagraph": 5164
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-05229",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说：箕子坚守正道，保持自我的行为说明，光明是不会熄灭的，只是暂时受阻碍罢了。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05229",
                "bodyParagraph": 5165
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "邵雍解（网页吉凶提要）",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-05231",
              "text": "平。该吉凶提示沿用用户所贴传统占解，仅供作为古代文献的一种理解。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05231",
                "bodyParagraph": 5167
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-05233",
              "text": "六五爻动，变为第63卦《既济卦》（水火既济）。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05233",
                "bodyParagraph": 5169
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻义与哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-05235",
              "text": "六五用箕子在殷末守正避祸的历史典故：宁可掩藏才智，也不助昏暴。表面晦暗，内心之明不可熄灭。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05235",
                "bodyParagraph": 5171
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-6",
      "position": 6,
      "label": "上六",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-05238",
              "text": "上六，不明晦；初登于天，后入于地。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05238",
                "bodyParagraph": 5174
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-05239",
              "text": "【白话】上六，不但没有光明，反而带来黑暗。刚开始时升起在天空，而后来却堕入地下。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05239",
                "bodyParagraph": 5175
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-05240",
              "text": "《象》曰：“初登于天”，照四国也；“后入于地”，失则也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05240",
                "bodyParagraph": 5176
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-05241",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说：“刚开始时升起在天空”，是说它的光明能够普照四方各国；“而后来却堕入地下”，是说它已经因违背正道而丧失了应有的作用，由光明转入了黑暗。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05241",
                "bodyParagraph": 5177
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-05243",
              "text": "上六爻动，变为第22卦《贲卦》（山火贲）。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05243",
                "bodyParagraph": 5179
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻义与哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-05245",
              "text": "上六原文应为“不明，晦；初登于天，后入于地。”象曰：“初登于天，照四国也；后入于地，失则也。”原网页此处把六五整段复制上来，应剔除重复，以上六原文单独重建。此爻象征由明转暗、居高失德，示警盛极不守则衰。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05245",
                "bodyParagraph": 5181
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "文本校勘",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-05247",
              "text": "原网页在“上九爻详解”标题下重复粘贴六五的箕子爻文、解卦及预测。此卦第六爻实为上六，已依据本次材料后段列出的上六原文及同主题白话底本单独整理，不将六五内容当作上六。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05247",
                "bodyParagraph": 5183
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "excludedParagraphs": 0
}
